.TH ZIONSTATS-TUI 1 "2026-10-19" "zionstats 0.7.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
zionstats-tui \- SHM-backed terminal UI (never initializes NVML)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zionstats-tui
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Attaches to the daemon's shared-memory frames and renders the dashboard:
LIVE/STALE/DAEMON-DOWN badges, GPU gauge cards, process table, control
row, alerts.  The binary never links or initializes NVML.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-i " SECONDS" ", " \-\-interval " SECONDS"
Refresh interval (floor 0.25).
.TP
.B \-\-readonly
Hide actuation keys.
.TP
.BI \-\-config " PATH"
Config path.
.TP
.B \-\-theme " NAME"
UI theme (16 built-ins; garbage falls back to predawn).
.SH KEYS
q quit; space/p pause; +/- rate; s cycle sort; t theme picker; o toggle
blower (when a controller is active and not readonly).
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR zionstats (1),
.BR zionstatsd (1)
